    "detailed_description": "<strong>Satan is dead.<br>Saints rule the Earth.<br>Get in touch with your divinity.</strong><br><br><strong>Dark fantasy pixelart hack-and-slash adventure.</strong><br>Explore a medieval world full of bizarre demons and even more fearsome zealots.<br>Lead a troop of Santifrancan crusaders, and other peculiar adventurers, in a fight against heretics &amp; demons while unraveling a sinister conspiracy.<br>Experience a revenge journey full of twists and turns as you explore a violent and quirky world.<br><strong>Battle over 30+ boss fights</strong> against demons, Saints, and everything in between.<br><br>War veteran Simon Vicario rejoins the military with nothing left to lose, only to end up having to re-examine his values and beliefs while protecting those he cares about. A story about re-finding meaning in life.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065930/extras/f5e279f7c80671ce85d64a917b216a01.avif?t=1733774957\" /></div><br><br>How will a man find meaning in a brutal world? Will you inspire your soldiers through hope or hatred?<br><strong>Hope and Hate Routes</strong> depending on player actions alter the story and feature route-exclusive content.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065930/extras/3c70bac5b56420ec65610b2606e8757e.avif?t=1733774957\" /></div><br><br><strong>Fully developed by a solo gamedev.</strong><br><strong>Game under development. Screenshots on store page are are subject to change.</strong><br><br>suomiperkele ikuinen is\u00e4nmaa finnish freedom forever",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Satan is dead.<br>Saints rule the Earth.<br>Get in touch with your divinity.</strong><br><br><strong>Dark fantasy pixelart hack-and-slash adventure.</strong><br>Explore a medieval world full of bizarre demons and even more fearsome zealots.<br>Lead a troop of Santifrancan crusaders, and other peculiar adventurers, in a fight against heretics &amp; demons while unraveling a sinister conspiracy.<br>Experience a revenge journey full of twists and turns as you explore a violent and quirky world.<br><strong>Battle over 30+ boss fights</strong> against demons, Saints, and everything in between.<br><br>War veteran Simon Vicario rejoins the military with nothing left to lose, only to end up having to re-examine his values and beliefs while protecting those he cares about. A story about re-finding meaning in life.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065930/extras/f5e279f7c80671ce85d64a917b216a01.avif?t=1733774957\" /></div><br><br>How will a man find meaning in a brutal world? Will you inspire your soldiers through hope or hatred?<br><strong>Hope and Hate Routes</strong> depending on player actions alter the story and feature route-exclusive content.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065930/extras/3c70bac5b56420ec65610b2606e8757e.avif?t=1733774957\" /></div><br><br><strong>Fully developed by a solo gamedev.</strong><br><strong>Game under development. Screenshots on store page are are subject to change.</strong><br><br>suomiperkele ikuinen is\u00e4nmaa finnish freedom forever",
